      },
      "timestamp": "2026-09-03T00:46:03.035045+00:00",
      "text": "IKEv1 responder detected\nThe external probe received an IKEv1 response. RFC 9395 moved IKEv1 to Historic status and calls for migration to IKEv2."
    },
    {
      "bom-ref": "annotation/01-ike.transport.prohibited",
      "subjects": [
        "endpoint"
      ],
      "annotator": {
        "component": {
          "bom-ref": "tool/qureddy",
          "name": "qureddy",
          "type": "application"
        }
      },
      "timestamp": "2026-09-03T00:46:03.035045+00:00",
      "text": "Prohibited IKE algorithm reported (DES, HMAC_MD5, HMAC_MD5_96)\nThe tool reported an encryption, PRF, or integrity algorithm that RFC 8247 marks MUST NOT for IKEv2. IKEv1 remains Historic under RFC 9395."
    },
    {
      "bom-ref": "annotation/02-ike.transport.legacy_3des",
      "subjects": [
        "endpoint"
      ],
      "annotator": {
        "component": {
          "bom-ref": "tool/qureddy",
          "name": "qureddy",
          "type": "application"
        }
      },
      "timestamp": "2026-09-03T00:46:03.035045+00:00",
      "text": "Legacy 3DES algorithm reported\nThe tool reported 3DES. RFC 8247 downgraded ENCR_3DES to MAY for IKEv2; its 64-bit block size warrants migration to an AEAD algorithm."
    },
    {
      "bom-ref": "annotation/03-ike.kex.classical",
      "subjects": [
        "endpoint"
      ],
      "annotator": {
        "component": {
          "bom-ref": "tool/qureddy",
          "name": "qureddy",
          "type": "application"
        }
      },
      "timestamp": "2026-09-03T00:46:03.035045+00:00",
      "text": "Classical IKE key exchange reported (2, 5, 14)\nThe responder transform reported a classical Diffie-Hellman group. A quantum computer could break recorded classical key establishment; authenticated tunnel posture remains outside this unauthenticated probe."
    },
    {
      "bom-ref": "annotation/04-ike.dh.weak",
      "subjects": [
        "endpoint"
      ],
      "annotator": {
        "component": {
          "bom-ref": "tool/qureddy",
          "name": "qureddy",
          "type": "application"
        }
      },
      "timestamp": "2026-09-03T00:46:03.035045+00:00",
      "text": "Weak IKE Diffie-Hellman group reported (2, 5)\nRFC 8247 marks groups 1 and 22 MUST NOT and groups 2, 5, 23, and 24 SHOULD NOT for IKEv2. This tool-reported transform does not prove final negotiation."
    },
    {
      "bom-ref": "annotation/05-ike.v1.aggressive.identity_exposed",
      "subjects": [
        "endpoint"
      ],
      "annotator": {
        "component": {
          "bom-ref": "tool/qureddy",
          "name": "qureddy",
          "type": "application"
        }
      },
      "timestamp": "2026-09-03T00:46:03.035045+00:00",
      "text": "IKEv1 aggressive mode exposed responder identity\nThe probe observed key exchange, nonce, and identity payloads before authentication. The identity value is intentionally excluded from logs and public evidence."
    }
  ]
